      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GENEROUS HARRY (1) tough gelding undefeated at this trip. Worked hard with the 61kg and cleared out for a slick 2.5 len victory over this track and trip. Produced good figures last start and winning apprentice hops back aboard. Can make it three wins for the preparation. JUST AWESOME (2) underrated gelding who created a big impression second up when taken to the front for a decisive win at this course and distance. Suitably placed again with Small's 3kg in a tougher race. PRINCESS CRUIZER (5) tough mare who saves her best for this track. Deep into the prep and look for her late. DIS IS HEAVEN (3) resumed with a respectable third over 1000m at Bowraville with the 64kg. Ran some handy races in town last time in and can run into the minor money.",
